  "limitations": [
    "This is a provisional browser assessment of the supplied screenshots and runtime narrative; no files, source, previous ratings or live application were inspected.",
    "Scores use the full browser range; deferred physical/native testing alone was not used to cap browser scores.",
    "For each item, A is the mean of hierarchy, typography and surfaces, F is the mean of clarity, feedback and accessibility, and overall is 0.4A + 0.6F with null dimensions excluded.",
    "The A>=9 and F>=9 threshold is not met across all screens and components; visual coherence is stronger than enlarged-layout efficiency and some state-specific feedback.",
    "Viewport-edge cropping in a scrollable screenshot does not establish unreachable content; supplied target and layout sweeps support reachability but do not show every scroll endpoint.",
    "Transition images show broadly consistent structure, while timing, cancellation, duplicate activation and motion claims rely on the supplied runtime report.",
    "The background-only feedback capture lacks enough context to determine whether users encounter its missing prompt; its low scores apply to that isolated presentation.",
    "No confirmed hard-gate failure is established by these materials, but background-only feedback visibility and residual birth-details status require clarification.",
    "Synthetic wording and long fixture content establish geometry only; they were not treated as production-copy defects or evidence of predictive quality.",
    "Current export loading/failure screenshots, enlarged Circles, successful microphone interaction and complete browser assistive-technology journeys are not represented.",
    "Physical iPhone, VoiceOver, native Dynamic Type, microphone/haptics, actual payments and OS share delivery remain unverified; no full/native 9/10 certification is issued.",
    "Offline Circles and sample Sky do not prove production social/auth behavior, and neither local readings nor tests establish predictive accuracy or novice usability."
  ],
